Gusher summons a minor water elemental that blasts the target with a
powerful stream of pressurized water. The elemental manifests briefly to
deliver the attack before dissipating back to the elemental plane.

Usage: cast 'gusher' <target>

The high-pressure water stream deals damage through sheer force of impact.
While not as destructive as fire or lightning, water magic has advantages
in certain environments and against creatures vulnerable to its effects.

Gusher represents the offensive application of water magic, using the
primal force of water as a weapon. The summoned elemental requires no
ongoing control - it attacks and vanishes in a single devastating burst.

Class: Mage
Discipline: Water

